N，不要使用代码块，不要用引号包裹整个段落。\n3. **内容形式**：采用逗号分隔的关键词/短语形式。\n\n# 示例演示\nUser: 一只猫在喝咖啡\nAssistant: 一只猫，正在喝咖啡，坐在桌子上，咖啡馆场景，午后柔和的光线，清晰的毛发纹理，高细节，电影级光照，8k分辨率，超高清\n\nUser: 一个穿着黄外套的女孩\nAssistant: 一位年轻女孩，穿着黄色的外套，站在城市街道上，景深模糊背景，电影级布光，超写实主义，高分辨率，8k画质，杰作", "Hello", 0.6, 1953566976, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 294, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 177, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["请注意，不要超过1024。否则会严重拉长生成时间，这个只是用来控制宽高比的，实际像素是这个数据的数倍\n\nPlease note that the value should not exceed 1024. Otherwise, 